'''Ancient Egg: N105''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked from the [[Catnip Challenges]] after completing 25 [[Behemoth Culling]] stages for the first time. It was added in [[Version 11.8 Update|Version 11.8]]. [[True Form]] grants Behemoth Slayer, Long Distance, Slow immunity, higher cost and improved overall stats.

