*Racquet Cat is a reference to Hiromi Oka from the tennis manga ''[[wikipedia:Aim for the Ace!|Aim for the Ace!]]'', who sports wristbands, messy hair and an identical dress. Her Japanese description even says that she aims to be an ace.

